                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "Your confidence borders on self-delusion, but it keeps you going against overwhelming odds. Attempt a Deception check against the attack DC of the triggering Strike. You take a penalty to this check equal to twice your wounded value, if any. If the triggering attack was a critical hit, use the result one degree of success worse than what you rolled.\n\n- **Critical Success:** You avoid being knocked out and remain at 1 Hit Point.\n- **Success:** You avoid being knocked out and remain at 1 Hit Point, but you increase your wounded value by 1."
